{"id": "16-2669-2-5", "zh": "Yata（词根）用于报复与报恩之义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2669-6-9", "zh": "yateti，yatayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2669-10-25", "zh": "加上 nī 时表示交还：yata 词根在前缀 ni 之后用于交还之义，如 niyyāteti、niyyātayati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2669-26-37", "zh": "如果把 ta 音变成 da 音，就有“niyyādeti、niyyādayati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2669-38-48", "zh": "车夫啊，把车交还了，你就无债一身轻地来吧”这些词形。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2670-2-4", "zh": "Vatu 用于言说之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2670-5-8", "zh": "vatteti，vattayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2671-2-4", "zh": "Pata 用于行走之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2671-5-8", "zh": "pateti，patayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2672-2-4", "zh": "Vāta 用于行走、安乐与侍奉之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2672-5-10", "zh": "行走、安乐、侍奉，这是三种意义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2672-11-14", "zh": "其中，“安乐”是指使人安乐。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2672-15-18", "zh": "vāteti，vātayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2672-19-22", "zh": "vāto（风），vātapupphaṃ（风花）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2672-23-25", "zh": "袈裟的 anuvāto（缘边）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2673-2-4", "zh": "Keta 用于召请之义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2673-5-8", "zh": "keteti，ketayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2673-9-10", "zh": "ketako。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2674-2-4", "zh": "Satta 用于相续的作用。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2674-5-9", "zh": "所谓相续的作用，就是连续不断的作用，也就是使之不间断。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2674-10-13", "zh": "satteti，sattayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2674-14-15", "zh": "satto。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2675-2-10", "zh": "“你为什么急急忙忙，割来青草，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2676-2-10", "zh": "对着已经断了气的老牛，一再说‘吃吧，吃吧’？”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2677-2-21", "zh": "不过在圣典中，对“gatasattaṃ jaraggavaṃ”这一读法，注释家们解释它的意思是“已经失去生命的老牛”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2677-22-44", "zh": "由此看来，satta 一词好像有“生命”的意思，就像在“靠拾穗和 paggaha 难以维生”这里，paggaha 一词好像是指钵一样。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2677-45-47", "zh": "这一点应当仔细考察。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2678-2-4", "zh": "Sutta 用于解开之义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2678-5-8", "zh": "sutteti，suttayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2679-2-4", "zh": "Mutta 用于排泄之义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2679-5-8", "zh": "mutteti，muttayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2679-9-12", "zh": "omutteti，omuttayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2679-13-14", "zh": "muttaṃ（尿）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2679-15-25", "zh": "这里有一句圣典文句：“mutteti ohadeti ca（小便，也大便）”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2679-26-31", "zh": "其中，**mutteti** 是指小便。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2679-32-36", "zh": "**ohadeti** 是指排出粪便。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2679-37-47", "zh": "在使役形中，有“muttāpeti、muttāpayati”这些词形。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2680-2-5", "zh": "Kattara 用于松弛之义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2680-6-9", "zh": "kattareti，kattarayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2680-10-11", "zh": "kattaro。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2680-12-15", "zh": "kattaradaṇḍo（老人杖），kattarasuppaṃ（旧簸箕）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2681-2-6", "zh": "其中，**kattaro** 是指衰老的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2681-7-10", "zh": "意思是说年老的。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2681-11-12", "zh": "这是依什么意义而说的？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2681-13-19", "zh": "依“kattarayati，即因肢体松弛而变得松弛”这一意义。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2681-20-29", "zh": "**kattaradaṇḍo**：因为这是衰老的人一定要拿的，所以是老人的手杖，叫做 kattaradaṇḍo。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2681-30-41", "zh": "所以义注师们说：“**kattaradaṇḍo** 是年老时要拿的手杖。”", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2681-42-45", "zh": "kattarasuppaṃ 是指旧簸箕。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2681-46-51", "zh": "既是旧的，又是簸箕，所以叫 kattarasuppaṃ，这是一个复合词。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2682-2-7", "zh": "Citta 用于彩绘之义，有时也用于显示之义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2682-8-10", "zh": "彩绘，就是使之变得斑斓多彩。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2682-11-14", "zh": "citteti，cittayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-2682-15-16", "zh": "cittaṃ（彩画）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2683-2-4", "zh": "以上是以 ta 结尾的词根的词形。", "confidence": 85}
